 margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">南極在今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">23</span>至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">26</span>日遭遇超級熱浪襲擊。（歐新社）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">〔即時新聞／綜合報導〕全球暖化持續加劇，南極今年初爆發超級熱浪，創下該地區有史以來最高溫紀錄，科學家對此事件進行的研究報告近日出爐，專家憂心，這種前所未見的現象恐對生態系帶來嚴重影響。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">根據《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CNN</span>》報導，最新發表在《全球變化生物學》期刊（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Global Change Biology journal</span>）的研究報告指出，南極在今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">23</span>至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">26</span>日遭超級熱浪襲擊，當地最低溫度攀升至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">0</span>度以上，最高溫度則達到攝氏<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7.5</span>度左右，創下當地有史以來最高溫紀錄。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">南極生態學家柏格斯通博士（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Dana Bergstrom</span>）表示，異常溫暖的夏天將對當地物種帶來負面影響，並對整個生態系統構成威脅。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">柏格斯通解釋，當地大多數生命均存活在小型無冰綠洲中，在夏天時很大程度地依賴著緩慢的融冰提供水分，但在熱浪襲擊下冰融化的速度太快，可能會形成洪水，傷害生物群落；而快速融冰的另一個缺點便是，若冰雪在季初融化完畢，整個生態系統都將在剩下的季節內面臨乾旱的困境。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://news.ltn.com.tw/news/world/breakingnews/3119781</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-04-06","clk_count":"206"}},"__N_SSG":true}